// The lobby's net game. On PS4 the lobby's choice is the net game manager's index itself (SetSelectedNetGameIdx 0x720610
// writes NGM+0x661c, the NetMenuHost readers such as 0x7508f0 read it): there is no second "selection" to fall back on
// (0x17d167c, which the C side calls the custom selection, is that same field). So the index is used as it is.
int16_t show_netgame(uintptr_t base) { return at<int16_t>(base + 0x17cb060u + 0x661c); }










